      "description": {
       "html": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Color Theory by Umami Seed Co x DNA Genetics is a feminized, solventless-focused hybrid bred from Original Z x Strawberry Banana Z, stacking Z genetics on both sides for a clean, candy-forward terpene profile with serious wash potential. Expect bright Z sweetness, smooth sugary fruit and a subtle strawberry finish, giving Color Theory a focused flavour profile that feels pure, polished and easy to place for terp-driven growers.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"></p><p>Compact, efficient and fast-finishing, Color Theory stays short with minimal stretch, tight internodal spacing and dense, trichome-rich buds. Flowering takes just 7-8 weeks, with medium to high yield potential and sandy resin heads that are specifically noted for dumping well in the wash. It is a strong choice for growers looking for fast turnaround, limited-space efficiency, clean Z terps and solventless-ready resin performance.</p>"
